gqx(){return"IronVibe does not teach you how to train and does not hand you ready-made programs \u2014 that is what a coach and your own experience are for. There is no catalog of thousands of exercises: you type movement names in your own words, and the app quietly does the counting. Everything stays on the device: no accounts, no subscriptions, no ads."},
