gmV(){return"An active recovery week?"},
oE(a,b){return"You've been training about "+a+" days a week for roughly "+b+" weeks. A good moment for an active recovery week: working weights and sets down 30\u201350%, or cardio only. This is a recommendation, not medical advice."},
